<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0648_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Falkner</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0648_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Who? You sound like you underwater.\nThis connection is trash. Fr.\rGet another line somewhere else, OK?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0648_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup...\nOK, now I can hear you.\fYeah, I’m in top form.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0648_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There any Block Bosses you ain’t\nscrapped yet?\fStep up! Get on it!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0648_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Let’s see... I’m usually free Saturday\nmornings.\fHit me up then.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0648_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I was hopin’ you’d call!\nWe scrappin’ again, right?{YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0648_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Excellent! Glad to hear it.\nI’m lookin’ forward to this.\rI’ll be waitin’ at the Saffron Dojo!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0648_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sure, sure...\nI know you got a busy schedule...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0648_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I gotta say this...\nBefore we scrap again, how ’bout you\fkeep the promises you made to\fothers first?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0648_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m waitin’ at the Saffron Dojo!\fThat was a promise!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0648_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, this Falkner.\nHow you doin’?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0648_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know our plans to meet at\nthe Saffron Dojo?\fThat’s still on your mind, ain’t it?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0648_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My dad told me somethin’ when I was\na youngblood.\rHe said “Falkner, bird homies don’t\njust fly with their wings, they soar\fthrough the sky ’cause that’s what\fthey want with their WHOLE heart.”\rThat’s just like my dad.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0648_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The scaffoldin’ in my Block was in bad\nshape when you came through, huh?\rEvery year, we give the place a\ndeep clean. It’s a challenge.\rBut the bird homies help us out,\nso we manage.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0648_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You chatted with Janine in\nFuchsia City, ain’t you?\rAll she ever talk about is her dad,\nyou know? Nonstop.\rI mean, it’s good to respect\nyour dad, but it’s\fbetter to have some confidence!\rDon’t you believe in your\nown abilities?</language>
	</row>
</body>
